        "Description": "Good evening 47.\r\rIt appears that Evin was not the Owl, but a decoy.\rThe identity of the real Owl is unknown. But we may have a lead.\r\rYour Target is Nicoletta Villani alongside her squad of mercenaries.\rVillani is a staunch opponent of Providence, and has  ordered her hit-squad to find information on the real Queen Anne II leaders. \r\rShe may be a scapegoat, but no Saint either, as she often orders her mercenaries to carry out hits, with no care for collateral damage.\r\rI&apos;ll leave you to prepare.",
